---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const title = 'Privacy Policy | Bible Bedtimes';
const description = 'Bible Bedtime Privacy Policy explaining what information is accessed when official publishing accounts are connected.';
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <Header />
  <main class="bg-night">
    <div class="wrap py-10 sm:py-16"><article class="measure">
      <h1 class="h1-page">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="small text-cream/70 mt-3">Last updated: November 5, 2026</p>

      <p class="lead mt-6">Bible Bedtime shares Bible story videos and bedtime reflections through official social media channels. This policy explains what information may be accessed when the account owner connects an official publishing account.</p>

      <aside class="mt-8 panel p-5 text-cream/[0.82]">
        Looking for the Bible Bedtimes iPhone and iPad app policy? Read the dedicated
        <a class="inline" href="/privacy/bible-bedtimes-ios/">Bible Bedtimes iOS Privacy Policy</a>.
      </aside>

      <aside class="mt-8 panel p-5 text-cream/[0.82]">
        Looking for the Spanish iPhone and iPad app policy? Read the dedicated
        <a class="inline" href="/privacy/bible-bedtime-espanol-ios/">Bible Bedtime Español iOS Privacy Policy</a>.
      </aside>

      <h2 class="h3-page mt-10">Information We Access</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-cream/[0.82]">When the Bible Bedtime account owner authorizes an official social platform connection, that platform may provide basic account information such as account ID, avatar, and display name, depending on approved permissions. This information is used only to confirm the authorized account and support publishing to the official Bible Bedtime profile.</p>

      <h2 class="h3-page mt-10">Publishing Data</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-cream/[0.82]">Approved Bible Bedtime video files and associated posting metadata may be sent to official social platforms for publishing. The workflow is not used to access or publish to unrelated accounts.</p>

      <h2 class="h3-page mt-10">Storage</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-cream/[0.82]">OAuth tokens and configuration files are stored privately on the account owner's local system or approved automation environment. Secrets are not intentionally published or shared in public chat, documentation, or source files.</p>

      <h2 class="h3-page mt-10">Sharing</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-cream/[0.82]">Bible Bedtime does not sell personal information. Data is shared with social platforms only as necessary to authorize the account and publish approved Bible Bedtime content.</p>

      <h2 class="h3-page mt-10">Retention</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-cream/[0.82]">Authorization tokens and related records are retained only as long as needed to operate the Bible Bedtime publishing workflow. Access can be revoked through TikTok account or app settings.</p>

      <h2 class="h3-page mt-10">This Website</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-cream/[0.82]">biblebedtime.uk uses Cloudflare Web Analytics to count page views. It works without cookies and without collecting personal data, so we can see which pages are read without identifying or tracking visitors.</p>

      <h2 class="h3-page mt-10">Contact</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-cream/[0.82]">For privacy questions, contact Bible Bedtime through the official TikTok profile: <a class="inline" href="https://www.tiktok.com/@biblebedtimestories22">@biblebedtimestories22</a>.</p>
    </article></div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
